{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"significand","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The magnitude of a floating-point value "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x"},{"type":"text","text":" of type "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"F"},{"type":"text","text":" can be calculated"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by using the following formula, where ","type":"text"},{"code":"**","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is exponentiation:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["x.significand * (F.radix ** x.exponent)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In the next example, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"y"},{"text":" has a value of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"21.5"},{"text":", which is encoded as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1.34375 * 2 ** 4"},{"text":". The significand of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"y"},{"text":" is therefore 1.34375.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let y: Double = 21.5","\/\/ y.significand == 1.34375","\/\/ y.exponent == 4","\/\/ Double.radix == 2"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If a type’s radix is 2, then for finite nonzero numbers, the significand","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is in the range ","type":"text"},{"code":"1.0 ..< 2.0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For other values of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x.significand"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is defined as follows:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"code":"x","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is zero, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"x.significand","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is 0.0.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"code":"x","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is infinite, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"x.significand","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is infinity.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"code":"x","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is NaN, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"x.significand","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is NaN.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The significand is frequently also called the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"mantissa","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"significand is the preferred terminology in the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"http:\/\/ieeexplore.ieee.org\/servlet\/opac?punumber=4610933"},{"text":", to allay confusion with the use of mantissa for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the fractional part of a logarithm.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The significand of the floating-point value.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","title":"significand","externalID":"s:SF11significandxvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","required":true,"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"significand","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"platforms":[{"name":"iO